From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YanIanZ <iwayanbagusaryadarma@student.telkomuniversity.ac.id>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:08:07 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] SourbyCraft - owned command blocks under region rules

Replaces the inherited Canvas/Folia hard-disable of command blocks and command-block minecarts with SourbyCraft's CommandBlockPolicy, behind aurora.world.command-blocks (default off = inherited behaviour). On: execute only on the owning region, region-local entity selectors and block targets while a command block's command runs, edits refused for blocks/minecarts another region owns, late output from other regions dropped.

